IFBNWAPMRSELT7VCQ
;
; REGISTERED USE ONLY!  This file will not be even read when unregistered
; Registered use gives you many benifits, including the ability to change
; the color of prompts and the ANS/ASC/RIP screens, multiple language
; support and more...
;
; This is the file that specifies what the menu item keys should be for
; the Main Menu, in single level menu style.  (-PREF.* screen files)
;
; You can use this file to override the defaults, if you change the screens
; to show different selections.  Only the first line of this file is read
; and no error checking is done, so be sure that the format is correct.
;
; To disable any menu option, simply put an asterisk (*) for the menu
; key, and OLMS will restrict this item.
;
; Order of keys should represent...
;
; Indexes
; File scan
; Bulletin selections
; News file
; Welcome screens
; Archiver
; Protocol
; Modify pointers
; Restore pointers
; Short conference listing
; Extension numbering
; Limiting factors
; Toggle global personal
; 7bit menus
; View settings
; Change packet format
; Quit back to main menu -> Go back to -MAIN2.* screen
